stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: Open relationships and restore allowlisted kind
  Loading --> Ready: Valid fresh snapshot arrives
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails or data is invalid
  Unavailable --> Loading: Explicit refresh
  Ready --> Ready: Select kind or intersect filters locally
  Ready --> Ready: Clear filters and reset visible limit
  Ready --> Ready: Switch tab and preserve URL
  Ready --> Refreshing: Refresh existing snapshot
  Refreshing --> Ready: Fresh snapshot arrives with filters retained
  Refreshing --> Ready: Transient failure retains unexpired snapshot
  Refreshing --> Unavailable: Snapshot expires or malformed initial response
  Ready --> Unavailable: Snapshot expires
  Ready --> Retired: Authorization denied
  Refreshing --> Retired: Authorization denied
  Loading --> Disposed: Leave page
  Ready --> Disposed: Dispose view
  Refreshing --> Disposed: Dispose view
  Disposed --> Disposed: Late completion ignored
  %% never Show an edge or introduction through a removed node.
  %% never Read business data when a local filter changes.
  %% never Repopulate retired or disposed data from a late request.
